usage: rebis.clink [-h] [--file FILE] [--stdin] COMMAND ...

rebis.clink — CLINK Chain & Organism Pipeline

positional arguments:
  COMMAND               Sub-command (run with COMMAND --help for details)
    layers              List CLINK layers L0–L8 with tier and C-score
    chain               Compute CLINK chain from tuple or name
    cscore              Compute consciousness score from tuple or name
    bridge              Compute bridges between components
    algebra             Run structural algebra (meet/join/tensor/distance)
    integrate           Compute integrated promotion path
    energy              Compute DFT energy ladder
    list                List all exported symbols
    info                Show available tools (alias for list)
    help                Show this help message

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --file FILE, -f FILE  Input file (JSON or FASTA/sequence)
  --stdin, -i           Read JSON arguments from stdin
